  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab>
               <hi rend="smallcaps">New Theatre Royal, Covent-Garden,</hi><lb/>
               This present <hi rend="allcaps">Saturday</hi>, <date when="1811-03-02">March 2, 1811</date>, will be acted (8th time) the Tragedy of<lb/>
               <bibl><title><hi rend="allcaps">Cato.</hi></title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Cato</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Kemble</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Porcius</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Young</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Marcus</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Brunton</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Lucius</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Murray</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Sempronius</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Barrymore</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Decius</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Cresswell</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Juba</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">C. Kemble</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Syphax</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Eferton</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Junius</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">King</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Titus</role> by <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Jefferies</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Marcia</role> by <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Egerton</hi>,<lb/>
                  <hi rend="italic">(Being her second appearance in London.)</hi></actor></castItem><lb/> 
                  <castItem><role>Lucia</role> by <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">S. Booth</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               To which will be added, <hi rend="italic">for the 10th time</hi>, the <hi rend="allcaps">Grand Dramatick Romance</hi> of<lb/>
               <bibl><title type="main"><hi rend="allcaps">Blue Beard;</hi></title><lb/>
                  <title type="sub"><hi rend="italic">Or,Female Curiosity.</hi></title></bibl><lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">With entirely new Scenes, Machinery, Dresses and Decorations.</hi><lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">The Musick composed and selected by Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Kelly</hi>.</hi><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Abomelique,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Barrymore</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Ibrahim,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Simmons</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Selim,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Taylor</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Shacabac,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Fawcett</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Hassan,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Menage</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Fatima,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Bolton</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Irene,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">C. Kemble</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Beda,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Liston</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role><hi rend="italic">Spahis</hi>,</role> Mess. <actor>Treby,</actor> <actor>King,</actor> <actor>Bishop,</actor> <actor>Hickman,</actor> <actor>Droset,</actor> <actor>Norris,</actor> <actor>Tinney,</actor> <actor>Crossman,</actor><lb/>
                     <actor>Davies,</actor> <actor>Makeen,</actor> &amp;c. &amp;c.</castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role><hi rend="italic">Janizaries</hi>,</role> Mess. <actor>I. Bellamy,</actor> <actor>Bond,</actor> <actor>Dixon,</actor> <actor>Everard,</actor> <actor>Fairclough,</actor> <actor>Lee,</actor> <actor>Linton,</actor> <actor>Montague,</actor> <actor>Norman,</actor> <actor>Street</actor><lb/>
                     <actor>J. Taylor,</actor> <actor>Terry,</actor> <actor>Tett,</actor> <actor>Williams,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role><hi rend="allcaps">Peasants</hi>,</role>Mesdames <actor>Coates,</actor> <actor>Findlay,</actor> <actor>Grimaldi,</actor> <actor>Hardy,</actor> <actor>Iliff,</actor> <actor>Johnson,</actor> <actor>Price,</actor> <actor>Whitmore</actor>,</castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               <hi rend="italic">The Dances by</hi><lb/>
               Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Parker</hi>,<lb/>
               Mess. Brown, Gaywood, Grant, Heath, Louis, Platt, Powers, Sarjant,<lb/>
               Mesdames Bologna, I. Bologna, Cox, Heath, Louis, Ryall, Standen, Watts.<lb/>
               Scenes painted by <hi rend="italic">Mess. Phillips, Whitmore, Pugh, Grieve, Hollogan, Hodgins,</hi> &amp; their assistants<lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">The Machinery by Mess. Saul and Bradwell. The Decorations by Mr. Bradwell.</hi><lb/>
               The Dresses by Mr. Flowers and Miss Egan.<lb/>
               Boxes <measure type="currency">7s</measure>. Second Price <measure type="currency">3s 6d</measure>.-Pit <measure type="currency">3s 6d</measure>. Second Price <measure type="currency">2s</measure>.<lb/>
               Lower Gallery <measure type="currency">2s</measure>. Second Price <measure type="currency">1s</measure>.-Upper Gallery <measure type="currency">1s</measure>. Second Price <measure type="currency">6d</measure>.<lb/>
               The Doors will be opened at <time when="17:30:00"><hi rend="allcaps">Half</hi> past <hi rend="allcaps">Five</hi></time>, and the Play begin at <time when="18:30:00"><hi rend="allcaps">Half</hi> past <hi rend="allcaps">Six</hi></time>.<lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">Vivant Rex &amp; Regina</hi>.<lb/>
               The Grand Dramatick Romance of <hi rend="allcaps">Blue Beard</hi>; or, <hi rend="smallcaps">Female Curisoity</hi>,<lb/>
               continuing to be recieved throughout with universal applause, will be repeated every<lb/>
               Evening till further notice.
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
  </text>
